  "historyNote": "#6722, eff 3-27-98; ss by #7893, eff 5-21-03; ss by #9857-A, eff 2-1-11; amd by #10199-A, eff 10-12-12; ss by #10867, eff 6-25-15; ss by #12729, INTERIM, eff 2-21-19, EXPIRES: 8-20-19; ss by #12852, eff 8-20-19; ss by #13428, eff 8-5-22",
